	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Where am I?",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"My field of vision is hazy and indistinct, shrouded in near darkness.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"What did I do after completing Soujin-sama's treatment at the bath?",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Ah, I remember. Isuzu gave me a lengthy talking-to.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"How as Exalt-Priestess, I need to conduct myself with more self-awareness.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"After that... I retired for the evening, and...",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nnh... What's this?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Suddenly, my vision clears.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"A faintly familiar man stands before me on a mountain path.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Could that be Soujin-sama?",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"No...",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"They look exactly alike, but this man exudes a wholly different aura.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Could this be...",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“Hey, Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Drenched with blood, the man laying at Mitsurugi-sama's feet nevertheless opens his mouth.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Though his chest is split open down the middle, his voice is that of someone without a single care in the world.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“This makes it how many times y've killed me now?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“This is the sixth.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“Ahaha, there y'go! Me memory's like a sieve, so lucky me I gots you 'round.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Killed six times? What does he mean?",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“Well, this time sure was pretty damn fun.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"The man turns his bloodshot eyes towards his surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Scattered all around him are too many corpses to count─men and women, young and old...",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“Y'see, I happened to come across the Exalt-Priestess\npayin' her respects, 'n I just couldn't help meself!”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“Wassat they say 'bout never refusin' a meal freely offered?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“Huh? That's not what that means?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What need had you to slay all her attendants?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“Settin' the scene.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“Can't paint a masterpiece by just slappin' the subject down in the middle of the canvas, y'know?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“In cookery and in portraiture, the set piece always, always needs its supporting elements...”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Without exception, every last corpse had the tendons in their legs severed.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Behind each victim, a long trail of blood stains the earth, giving the impression of a child's messy scribbles.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Even in their last moments, they struggled, and resisted, and protected each other─",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"All while this man made a mockery of their lives, cruelly cutting them down one after another as they tried desperately to crawl away.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ugh, ghh...!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"The sight of this gruesome scene makes me sick to the stomach.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“Still, though... wish I'd at least gotten meself a better haul.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“This few ain't close to bein' enough to satisfy me...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"The man coughs up a lungful of blood as he lets out a throaty chuckle.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Mitsurugi-sama does not so much as twitch an eyebrow.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Filthy Brigand"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, old chap, next time how 'bout─”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Be still.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"With not a trace of expression on his face, Mitsurugi-sama dispassionately swings his blade down.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh-What... was that?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"My heart is hammering a furious beat.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"This should be but a dream.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Yet everything felt all too real.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"As though I were watching a motion picture from inside the silver screen itself.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Dying Woman"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"The next sight before me is that of a young woman nigh unto death.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Her limbs are bent in a manner that defies all anatomy.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"It is clear that someone took delight in treating her broken body as a plaything.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Forgive me... If only I'd arrived sooner...”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Dying Woman"},
			{
"“Hehee, please do not let it trouble your noble heart...”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Dying Woman"},
			{
"“Dying here must surely... have been my destiny...”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"As Mitsurugi-sama touches her cheek, she smiles the sincere smile of one who has been redeemed.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Well-Dressed Man"},
			{
"“S'your own damn fault for taking your sweet time, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Well-Dressed Man"},
			{
"“If only you'd've come sooner, this woman wouldn't've needed to die, and this village wouldn't've needed to burn.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Well-Dressed Man"},
			{
"“I warned you, didn't I? I'd pile up another hundred corpses every hour 'till y'stopped me.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Shut up.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Mitsurugi-sama glares at the man collapsed at his feet.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"The man is garbed in the finery of a well-to-do merchant, but terrifyingly, his upper and lower halves are split atwain.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"However, heedless of his missing legs, the man continues to speak with blithe indifference.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"His is not any mortal existence.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“If your grudge is with me, satisfy your vengeance with mine life and be done with it! Why must you implicate the lives of innocents?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Well-Dressed Man"},
			{
"“Ain't it more fun this way?!”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Well-Dressed Man"},
			{
"“'Sides, it was your own damn fault for gettin' involved with this woman and her village.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Well-Dressed Man"},
			{
"“What a wicked man you are, Mitsurugi! Serves y'right!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Well-Dressed Man"},
			{
"“Ahaha, hahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You fiend...!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Dying Woman"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, please... pay no heed to that man's words...”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Dying Woman"},
			{
"“I was truly blessed... to have met you...”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Dying Woman"},
			{
"“To ease my suffering... might I ask of you... one last kindness...?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Wordlessly, Mitsurugi-sama rises before her.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"His blade catches the light, and the woman's soul is put to rest.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Well-Dressed Man"},
			{
"“Hoo-whee! Your bladework is as fine as ever!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Well-Dressed Man"},
			{
"“That's the savior of the realm for you!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"The next instant, the man's remaining body is split atwain once more.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"I am beginning to understand.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"This is Mitsurugi-sama... Soujin-sama's dream.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Soujin-sama has entered my dream once before.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Now, the opposite must be happening.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"As evidence, if I attune my consciousness, I can feel\nSoujin-sama's emotions as my own.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I can brush against his noble, wounded heart, stretched so close to the point of breaking.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"I wish to know more and more about him...",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"And so, I bring my heart ever closer to his─",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"I cast mine gaze towards the endless spring sky.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"─How many times have I slain that man now?",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Yet he reappears each time, taking on a new form to blend in amongst the people before carrying out his slaughter.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"With each cycle, his methods become more and more cunning.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"At first, he merely killed with his own two hands, but eventually, he took to manipulating the hearts of others, inciting massacres and rebellions.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"With this, the number of his victims rose dramatically.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Even as thousands upon thousands of innocents perish in the flames of rebellion, he needn't ever give himself away.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"He merely watches from a safe place, delighting in the carnage, drunk on the slaughter.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"There is no better way to describe his existence than as a calamity─",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"A dread spirit of death and destruction unleashed upon the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"He appears without warning, wreaking ruin upon all that the people have toiled so hard to build.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"In time, mine thoughts conjured for him a name─Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"To prevent Kahaku's sinister conspiracies from coming to fruition, I have also taken to living amongst the people.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"─Find him and vanquish him before he claims any victims.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"For as long as Kahaku does not disappear, that is all I am able to do.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Gh...! *Cough...!*”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“*Cough!* Haah... haah...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Heh... hahahahaha... You win this time! Can't believe I\ndidn't even gets meself a hundred...”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You're gettin' good at this, Mitsurugi!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"His head separated cleanly from his shoulders, Kahaku grins widely at me.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Kahaku, what manner of fiend are you?!”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“If Kahaku's what you're gonna call me, Kahaku's what I'll be.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I really do likes me the ring of that.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Why do you kill?! Why ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"must",
{"/font"},
" you kill?! Why will you not begone and leave us in peace?!”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Heh, haha, ahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I just wanna be a blot on the landscape of the Empire.\nThat's all me lil' heart ever desired.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Ain't gots me any other reason.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Though, come to think of it, I've always felt a bit of an artistic callin' in me.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Just makin' a mess of the canvas ain't good enough.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“It's gotta be all the more extravagant, all the more beautiful, all the more gruesome... All the better to ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"see you suffer,",
{"/font"},
" Mitsurugi, old chap.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"I say nothing, having long since exhausted all mine curses.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"No mere words are capable of expressing mine enmity for Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Next time, I'll treat you to a real masterpiece.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Shut up.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Look forward to─!”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Shut up!”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"No matter how many times I slay him, Kahaku always appears once more.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Even as new Emperors accede to the throne, even as the world changes around us, our fight shall continue─",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Forever... For ages more...",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"An unremitting requital upon this undying existence of mine.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Young Priestess"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, may I please hold your hand?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Living amongst the townsfolk, I am unable to avoid interacting with others.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"And existing within the world of man, even a tool such as I cannot help but to form precious bonds.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Yet the seasons change ever so quickly.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Before mine ageless eyes, all that is precious to me passes me by in the blink of an eye.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"The lives of mine “brides”─the succession of Exalt-Priestesses who supply me their magicks─are especially fleeting.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, I have a most felicitous announcement to make.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“I have been selected to become the next Exalt-Priestess!”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“If it pleases you, I would be most honored to serve at your side.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"The girl I'd thought a mere child just the other day is to be ordained as the next Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“To serve you has been my dream ever since I was a child.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“I hope to render unto you most faithful service.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You have mine thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"The duty of the Exalt-Priestess is to maintain mine body.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Whenever I expend mine power battling Kahaku or quelling rebellions, the Exalt-Priestess invokes prodigious amounts of her magicks to replenish it.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"However, just as with Himi-no-Mikoto, the use of magicks necessarily corrupts the body.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Thus and so, one Exalt-Priestess after another shaves away her life in service to me─",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“Thank you... for treasuring me all this time... Mitsurugi-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“Did I... manage to serve you faithfully?”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I'm sorry to have taken so much from you.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“It is quite all right, Mitsurugi-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“This was my purpose─the duty of all Exalt-Priestesses. There could be no higher honor.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I am thankful, from the bottom of mine heart, for your devotion.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama... I leave the future of the Empire in your hands.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Exalt-Priestess"},
			{
"“To have served at your side... was my life's greatest blessing.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Having offered me the last measure of her devotion, another Exalt-Priestess's all too short life slips away through mine fingers.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Countless long years have passed since Himi-no-Mikoto's soul set out on its long sojourn.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"By now, the name “Mitsurugi” has been forgotten by all save for the Emperor and the Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"The succession of Exalt-Priestesses are mine only remaining companions, confidantes, and comrades-in-arms.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Perhaps Chihaya, as mine first Exalt-Priestess, truly did put it best when she described her station as mine bride.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Yet... I am always parted from mine brides all too soon.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Some are consumed by the corruption, having given their everything to me, and others are slain by Kahaku, but each of them is cruelly taken before their time.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"And no matter how often it happens, the death of those most precious to me lacerates mine heart just as it did the first time.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"As all that is precious to me inevitably slips through mine fingers─",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"More and more scars are imperishably graven upon mine increasingly human heart.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Indeed, the interminable march of time spares not even an ageless being as myself.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Before I know it, only I remain, left behind by everything I once held dear.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Yet even so...",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“We meet again, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Kahakuuu!”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Even so, I shall not rest.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Decades, centuries, millennia may pass me by─",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"But I shall continue fulfilling the purpose I was given, cutting down all calamity befalling the Empire─",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Until the day you come back to me.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto...”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Where are you right now?”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
